        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "If you hang out with them and people see you with them, they will
          laugh at you\u2026 you might become one of them!"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Si te juntas con ellos y la gente te ve con ellos, se reir\xE1n de
          ti... \xA1podr\xEDas volverte uno de ellos!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Wenn Du mit ihnen abh\xE4ngst und die Leute Euch sehen, werden sie
          Dich auslachen \u2026 vielleicht wirst Du einer von ihnen!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: 
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Jos hengailet heid\xE4n kanssaan ja jos ihmiset n\xE4kev\xE4t sinut
          heid\xE4n kanssaan, he nauravat sinulle... Sinusta saattaa tulla yksi heist\xE4!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
