        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I don't think this is  fair, look at those people there, look at those
          people there, they have the same rights as you and me
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "No me parece justo, mira a esa gente de ah\xED, tienen los mismos
          derechos que t\xFA y yo."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Ich finde das nicht fair. Schau Dir die Leute dort an. Sie haben die
          gleichen Rechte wie Du und ich.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: 
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Minusta t\xE4m\xE4 ei ole reilua, katso noita ihmisi\xE4, heill\xE4
          on samat oikeudet kuin sinulla ja minulla."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 46
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
