    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Great! Anger is useful to defend a position. Use that energy to protect
          yourself, not to fight. If it is too intense and you let yourself get carried
          away by anger, you are more likely to act without thinking and hurt yourself
          or others....
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Bien! La ira es \xFAtil para defender una posici\xF3n. Utiliza esa
          energ\xEDa para protegerte, no para luchar. Si es demasiado intensa y te
          dejas llevar por la ira, es m\xE1s probable que act\xFAes sin pensar y
          te hagas da\xF1o a ti mismo o a los dem\xE1s..."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Super! Wut ist n\xFCtzlich, um eine Position zu verteidigen. Nutze
          diese Energie, um Dich zu sch\xFCtzen, nicht um zu k\xE4mpfen. Wenn sie
          zu intensiv ist und Du Dich von der Wut mitrei\xDFen l\xE4sst, handelst
          Du eher un\xFCberlegt und verletzt Dich selbst oder andere...."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: 
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Hienoa! Suuttumus on hy\xF6dyllinen, kun on puolustettava n\xE4k\xF6kantaansa.
          K\xE4yt\xE4 sen tuomaa energiaa puolustaaksesi itse\xE4si, \xE4l\xE4 tapellaksesi.
          Jos tunne on liian voimakas ja antaudut sen valtaan, k\xE4ytt\xE4ydyt todenn\xE4k\xF6isemmin
          ajattelematta ja loukkaat itse\xE4si tai muita. Olosi on sen j\xE4lkeen
          tasapainoisempi\u2026 Jatka!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
