    - id: 6
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Ok\u2026 It might be hard to feel like this, but it means that you
          care about what you are doing and you want to do it well\u2026 Learn what
          you have to learn about it and move on.. It will pass!"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: es
        value: "Vale... Puede que sea duro sentirse as\xED, pero significa que te
          importa lo que haces y quieres hacerlo bien... Aprende lo que tengas que
          aprender al respecto y sigue adelante... Ya pasar\xE1."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: "Ok... Es mag schwer sein, sich so zu f\xFChlen, aber es bedeutet,
          dass Ihnen wichtig ist, was Sie tun, und dass Sie es gut machen wollen...
          Lernen Sie, was Sie dar\xFCber lernen m\xFCssen, und machen Sie weiter.
          Es wird vor\xFCbergehen!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: 
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fi
        value: "Okei\u2026 On ehk\xE4 vaikea tuntea n\xE4in, mutta se tarkoittaa,
          ett\xE4 v\xE4lit\xE4t siit\xE4, mit\xE4 teet ja haluat tehd\xE4 sen oikein\u2026
          Opi se, mit\xE4 sinun on opittava siit\xE4, ja jatka matkaa... Se menee
          kyll\xE4 ohi!"
