    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "I\u2019ve been training for this day since I was very little\u2026
          I even remember the first day I started, my dad took me\u2026 I am not
          saying that I made this sport my entire life, but I sure have dedicated
          lots of my free time to master it. Almost every day, with sun, rain, snow.
          My family was very proud of my progress. And I kept going. You know me,
          I am not big \u2013 headed. I mean, I kept my feet on the ground and focused
          on improving myself. I was so happy to have the chance to audition for
          our school\u2019s sport team, finally becoming part of something a bit
          bigger. I got ready, gave 100%. Then went to the audition and didn\u2019t
          make it. At first, I was shocked, I thought I was ready, I was good. I
          don\u2019t really know what happened. Maybe I need to train more and try
          again next year. Or maybe I could try somewhere else. But I\u2019d like
          to be part of a team."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
